Package: emulandice2
Type: Package
Title: Emulandice: emulation of multi-model estimates of the land ice contribution to sea level rise
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: person("Tamsin", "Edwards", email = "tamsin.edwards@kcl.ac.uk",
  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Maintainer: Tamsin L. Edwards <tamsin.edwards@kcl.ac.uk>
Description: This code is used to emulate projections of the ice sheet and 
    glacier contributions to sea level rise to 2300 (and intermediate times).
    If running build stage, requires packages glmnet for testing for inert inputs,
    and config for YAML configuration files.
    If running predict stage, requires ncdf4 package for reading climate input file
    and writing sea level output files.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Depends:
    R (>= 4.4.0)
Imports: 
    config,
    methods,
    mvtnorm,
    ncdf4,
    glmnet,
    RobustGaSP
Suggests:
    deepgp,
    dgpsi,
    laGP
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
